	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 全長約30cm、迫力の大型サイズ。シンプルなパーツ構成で組み立てやすい上に、映画登場モデルを忠実に再現した満足の仕上がり。",
			"• 左右の目の微妙な形状違いや顔周りのパーツの色等も忠実に再現。グロスインジェクション成形によるアーマーの質感再現。",
			"• 新たな関節ギミックでより自然なポージングが可能になり、劇中のシーンも再現可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• Approximately 30cm in total length, impressively large size. The simple parts configuration makes it easy to assemble, and the finished product faithfully reproduces the model that appeared in the movie.",
			"• The subtle differences in the shape of the left and right eyes and the colors of parts around the face are also faithfully reproduced. The texture of the armor is reproduced by gloss injection molding.",
			"• A new joint gimmick allows for more natural poses, allowing you to recreate scenes from the movie."
		]
	},
